  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JAS 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwami, bayi mwikala nakwitiya Mwanta wetu Yesu Kristu walema, nakwakama antu kumesuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi muchipompelu chenu mukwijila muntu wavwala kazeya kawuru nimahina amawahi, mwiŋila nawa nikazweŋi wavwala mahina atama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enu himukulemesha owu wavwala mahina amawahi, himukwila nenu, Shakamaku hanu hahawahi; himukumwila kazweŋi nenu, Imanaku oku; indi kwiji, Shakamaku hamaseki kunyendu yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwelaŋa mwenomu, mwaambulaŋa mukachi kenu, munekali akwakusompesha nayitoŋojoka yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu enu ana kwami nakeŋa, Nzambi watondeli atuzweŋi abula yuma yamunu mwishina kwikala akwakuheta mukukuhwelela, nianswana awanta wakaniniyi antu amukeŋa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila enu munadiwuli kazweŋi. Akwakuheta hidiwu ayikabishaŋenu nakuyikokela muyota yakusompelaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidiwu nawa atukaŋa ijina dalema dayitenaŋawuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwovwahilaŋa lushimbi lwawanta lwamwaya mukanda wajila wakwila nawu, Keŋaku mukwenu neyi chiwadikeŋa eyi aweni; mwelaŋa chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila neyi mwaakamaŋa antu kumesu mwavulumunaŋa, lushimbi ilu lunayihishi, muneli dehi akwanyiloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa muntu wukuhemba nshimbi jejima, Ilaŋa hakuluwa muchuma chimu, nahi kunshimbi jejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yena welili nindi, Kwila wuvumbi chinjila; diyi nawa welili nindi, Kujaha muntu chinjila. Nochu neyi wunabuli kwila wuvumbi, ilaŋa wunajahi mukwenu, wunamotoki dehi nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshenuŋa nakwila mwatelela antu akasompeshawu nalushimbi lwawaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukubula kutiyila akwawu luwi akumusompesha chakadi luwi; luwi lwemikaŋa kusompesha mushindu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwami, neyi muntu wukwila nindi ni kweti kwitiya, ilaŋa kwila nyidimu nehi, chikukwashana ŋahi? Kwitiyoku kukutwesha kumuhandisha, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mana kwenu hela muhelenu wudi nawuvu, nabuli yakudya yalelu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwinenu wumu hakumwila nindi, Endaku chachiwahi, tiyaku iyena, ikutaku; hakwila kumwinka yuma yakumujimba yanakaankiliyi nehi, chikukwashana ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nikwitiya kwakadi nyidimu kukudifwila kanka waku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwiji kukwikala muntu wukuhosha nindi, Eyi wukweti kwitiya, ami ni kweti nyidimu; nleji kwitiya kweyi kwakadi nyidimu yeyi, ninami nukukuleja kwitiya kwami nanyidimu yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wetiyaloŋa neyi Nzambi wekala wumu; welaŋa chachiwahi. Ademoni niwena etiyaloŋa, hiyakuza ala nikuzaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi muntu wabula maana, ilukaku neyi kwitiya kwakadi nyidimu kwamukunkulwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkakulula yetu Abarahama, chalambwiliyi mwanindi Isaka hakameŋa haloŋeli nanyidimuku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunamoni kwitiya kwakoŋeli chimu nanyidimu yindi, nikwitiya kwelili kwalala nanyidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu mwalumbulukila mukanda wajila welili nawu, Abarahama wamwitiyili Nzambi, amufuukwililichu nawu hikuloŋa, hiyakumutena nawu ibwambu daNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munamoni komana muntu waloŋaŋa nanyidimu, bayi nakwitiya hohuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwomumu nichivumbi Rahaba nawa waloŋeli nanyidimu, hatambwiliyi antemesha nakuyifuntisha njila yacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chafwa mujimba wakadi spiritu, dichi nikwitiya kwakadi nyidimu kwafwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
